      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 28: from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the Holm house; around 09:16 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:15 to 10:15 I was at the Carver house; around 10:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 10:18 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 11:30 I was at home.",
