      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 28: from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the Dunmore house; around 09:19 I passed through the square; around 09:25 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:30 to 10:15 I was at the Vale house; around 10:19 I passed through Mill Road; from about 10:30 to 11:15 I was at the Carver house; around 11:20 I passed through Mill Road; from about 11:30 to 11:30 I was at the square.",
