      "key": "K0390",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 28: from about 08:30 to 09:00 I was at the Dunmore house; around 09:06 I passed through the square; around 09:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:15 to 10:15 I was at the Kessler house; around 10:17 I passed through Mill Road; from about 10:15 to 11:30 I was at home.",
      "time": 39387,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
