      "key": "K0533",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 28: from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the Okafor house; around 09:15 I passed through the square; around 09:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:30 to 10:15 I was at the Kessler house; around 10:08 I passed through Mill Road; around 10:14 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 11:30 I was at home.",
      "time": 39387,
      "topics": [
