      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 28: from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the Ash house; around 09:09 I passed through the square; around 09:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:15 to 11:15 I was at home; around 11:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:15 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 11:30 I was at the Drover's Rest.",
